<title>JAPAN: BOJ to announce &quot;tankan&quot; survey result on April 2.</title>
<headline>BOJ to announce &quot;tankan&quot; survey result on April 2.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Wednesday it would release the result of its next quarterly &quot;tankan&quot; survey of business sentiment at 8.50 a.m. on April 2 (2350 GMT, April 1).</p>
